<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Details of <span id="A1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">GeoDSL</span></h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Details of Predicates</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.1 Details of Predicates ‣ Appendix A Details of GeoDSL ‣ Enhancing Geometric Perception in VLMs via Translator-Guided Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> lists the <em id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">element</em> predicates, each of which returns a primitive geometric object.
Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ A.1 Details of Predicates ‣ Appendix A Details of GeoDSL ‣ Enhancing Geometric Perception in VLMs via Translator-Guided Reinforcement Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> enumerates the <em id="A1.SS1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">constraint</em> predicates together with their parameters and semantics.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Predicates that return geometric primitives in GeoDSL.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T6.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Predicate</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Parameters</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Example</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T6.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Point</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A1.T6.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">label: str | null</span></td>
